@startuml
title 리뷰 시스템 시퀀스 다이어그램

actor User
boundary Browser
control ReviewController
entity ReviewService
entity OrderService
entity PointService
database DB

User -> Browser : 리뷰 작성
Browser -> ReviewController : POST /reviews (productId, rating, content, images)
ReviewController -> OrderService : validatePurchaseHistory(userId, productId)
OrderService -> DB : SELECT * FROM orders o\nJOIN order_items oi ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\nWHERE o.user_id = ? AND oi.product_id = ?\nAND o.status = 'DELIVERED'
alt 구매 이력 있음
    OrderService --> ReviewController : 구매 확인 완료
    ReviewController -> ReviewService : validateReviewPermission(userId, productId)
    ReviewService -> DB : SELECT COUNT(*) FROM reviews\nWHERE user_id = ? AND product_id = ?
    alt 이미 리뷰 작성
        ReviewService --> ReviewController : 중복 리뷰 오류
    else 리뷰 작성 가능
        ReviewController -> ReviewService : createReview(reviewData)
        ReviewService -> DB : INSERT INTO reviews
        ReviewService -> ReviewService : updateProductRating(productId)
        ReviewService -> PointService : grantReviewPoints(userId, 100)
        PointService -> DB : UPDATE points SET balance = balance + 100
        ReviewController --> Browser : 리뷰 작성 완료
    end
else 구매 이력 없음
    OrderService --> ReviewController : 구매 이력 없음
    ReviewController --> Browser : 리뷰 작성 권한 없음
end

@enduml